DESCRIPTION:Ha Florence!\nIk ben jouw buddy en help je met alle vragen die je wellicht in de komende/weken maanden hebt.\n\n________________________________________________________________________________\nMicrosoft Teams meeting\nJoin: https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/321399222918713?p=nwU34aGmzTiIU3Bnca\nMeeting ID: 321 399 222 918 713\nPasscode: sN6ny3DM\n________________________________\nHeeft u hulp nodig?<https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=nl-NL> | System reference<https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_NmI0ZDA0YTItMGJkZi00MzdiLWJmNWUtMDExOTVmZDk2NjY2%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%2272fca1b1-2c2e-4376-a445-294d80196804%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22c097f7e3-d21e-4120-917a-9f34de70e710%22%7d>\nFor organizers: Vergaderopties<https://teams.microsoft.com/meetingOptions/?organizerId=c097f7e3-d21e-4120-917a-9f34de70e710&tenantId=72fca1b1-2c2e-4376-a445-294d80196804&threadId=19_meeting_NmI0ZDA0YTItMGJkZi00MzdiLWJmNWUtMDExOTVmZDk2NjY2@thread.v2&messageId=0&language=nl-NL>\n________________________________________________________________________________\n
